    <briefdescription>
<para>This class wraps an output stream for a file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Most clients should just be able to return an instance of this base class from the stream callback, but if a client needs to perform some action after the stream is written to, that can be done by deriving from this class and overriding the destructor. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
